  "description": {
   "en": "After our protagonist saves a girl dressed as an elf at a doujinshi event, she starts calling him \"Hero\". He thought it was only a temporary role-playing session, but it seems the girl is serious about it... The curtains open for the difficult days ahead for the amnesiac elf and our protagonist, who was supposed to be an unremarkable person!",
   "ja": "エルフとの二人暮らしは可愛いだけじゃない!?\n\n同人即売会でエルフの恰好をした少女を助けた主人公は少女に「勇者さま」と呼ばれる。その場限りのロールプレイだと思いきやどうやら本気のようで…!?記憶喪失のエルフと平凡だったはずの主人公の前途多難な日々が幕を開ける!"
  },
